sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor T as Admin almacén<br/>STORE_ADMIN
    actor S as Admin StyleRadar<br/>STYLERADAR_ADMIN
    participant GW as API Gateway :8080
    participant C as ms-tiendas :8140<br/>JwtAuthFilter · Controller
    participant UC as RegistrarAlmacen /<br/>VerificarAlmacen
    participant B as Azure Blob Storage
    participant DB as PostgreSQL 16
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ<br/>styleradar.exchange

    T->>GW: POST /api/v1/stores/documents/rut (multipart, PDF ≤ 5 MB)
    GW->>C: Bearer JWT de ms-auth (HS256 validado en el servicio)
    C->>UC: subirDocumentoRut(...)
    UC->>B: sube el PDF del RUT
    UC-->>T: 201 {url}
    T->>GW: POST /api/v1/stores {nit, tradeName, ..., rutPdfUrl}
    GW->>C: Bearer JWT
    C->>UC: registrarAlmacen(request, userId, rol)
    UC->>UC: Almacen.validarDatosObligatoriosRegistro()
    UC->>DB: existsByNit(nit)
    alt NIT ya registrado
        UC-->>T: 409 CONFLICT (errors.nit)
    else NIT nuevo
        UC->>DB: INSERT almacenes (PENDING) + administradores_almacenes
        UC-)MQ: store.verification.changed (PENDING)
        UC-->>T: 201 {verificationStatus: PENDING}
    end
    S->>GW: PATCH /api/v1/admin/stores/{nit}/verification {decision, reason}
    GW->>C: Bearer JWT (rol STYLERADAR_ADMIN)
    C->>UC: decidir(nit, decisión, adminId, rol)
    UC->>DB: findByNit → decidirVerificacion → UPDATE
    UC-)MQ: store.verification.changed (APPROVED · REJECTED, previousStatus)
    UC-->>S: 200 {verificationStatus}
    Note over C,DB: Solo los almacenes APPROVED aparecen en GET /api/v1/stores (público)
